  "title": "Ukraine and Russia: U.S. President Trump Calls on Zelenskyy to Stop Strikes Against Russian Oil Refineries",
  "summary": "U.S. President Donald Trump called on Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelenskyy to halt strikes on Russian oil refineries and infrastructure, citing the attacks as causing a global fuel shortage. Ukraine has been targeting Russia's oil industry for months, prompting fuel rationing and Moscow banning diesel exports, while the global crisis also came after the war on Iran curtailed oil shipments through the Strait of Hormuz.",
